The Int64, UInt64, Int64Vector, and UInt64Vector classes in
runtime/src/as3flatbuffers/types/ are adapted from AS3PB:

    https://github.com/33TU/as3pb
    source revision: 6849308 (royale branch)
    original path: runtime/src/as3pb/types/

The original AS3PB code is by 33TU. These files retain its behavior, with the
package renamed and protobuf-specific input/output comments generalized.
This repository is distributed under the MIT License in LICENSE.

internal/indent.go and its tests are also adapted from AS3PB's internal/indent.go
and internal/indent_test.go at the same revision. The test import path points to
this repository; the writer behavior is unchanged.

internal/naming_cases.go, the reserved-word map in internal/naming.go, and
uniqueName in internal/naming_table.go are adapted from AS3PB's naming_cases.go,
naming.go, and naming_message.go at the same revision. The reserved-word test is
adapted from naming_test.go. FlatBuffers-specific names and field-ID allocation
replace the protobuf descriptor wrappers; the initial generator's additional
keyword guards are retained.

The generated Point example and FlatBuffers table runtime follow the public
FlatBuffers wire format. The test harness uses, but does not vendor, the official
FlatBuffers Python package (Apache-2.0).

internal/reflection/upstream/reflection.fbs and the generated Go bindings in
internal/reflection/reflection_generated.go derive from Google FlatBuffers
v25.12.19 (https://github.com/google/flatbuffers), under Apache-2.0.
The upstream license is included at internal/reflection/upstream/LICENSE.
